graph LR
    subgraph Orchestrator [Orchestrator Server]
        AT[AcpTransport<br/>ClientTLS]
    end

    subgraph WorkerMachine [Worker Machine]
        subgraph FW [fleet-worker Daemon]
            Proxy[MtlsProxy<br/>0.0.0.0:2420]
        end
        Grok[grok agent serve<br/>127.0.0.1:2419 loopback]
    end

    AT -->|wss:// mTLS 사설 CA<br/>클라이언트 인증서 제출| Proxy
    Proxy -->|TLS 종단 & 검증 후<br/>평문 TCP 복사| Grok
